WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.580
Watch and read: Ama asks: Ama tells a story about sharing. Which action matches that

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:05.939
theme?

00:00:06.783 --> 00:00:11.492
The answer is: Shares food with a neighbour. A good cultural story connects people

00:00:11.492 --> 00:00:12.501
and shared values.

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:18.984
Watch and read: Ama asks: Imagine you are acting as a friendly shopkeeper. What helps

00:00:18.984 --> 00:00:20.108
the audience understand?

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:26.219
The answer is: Use matching words and actions. Role-play uses speech, actions and

00:00:26.219 --> 00:00:27.030
character feelings.
